1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Selamat datang.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,109
Apa topik video hari ini?

3
00:00:05,109 --> 00:00:09,670
Ini adalah percakapan di restoran.

4
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Babak 1: Latihan Percakapan Pemesanan / Ordering Conversation Practice

5
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:14,608
Permisi.

6
00:00:14,630 --> 00:00:18,137
Iya, selamat datang.

7
00:00:18,161 --> 00:00:22,073
Silakan duduk di sini.

8
00:00:22,096 --> 00:00:25,066
Terima kasih.

9
00:00:25,089 --> 00:00:29,478
Bolehkah saya memesan?

10
00:00:29,501 --> 00:00:34,035
Iya, silakan pesan.

11
00:00:34,058 --> 00:00:36,924
Mau makan apa?

12
00:00:36,947 --> 00:00:41,614
Menu rekomendasi hari ini apa?

13
00:00:41,637 --> 00:00:48,674
Saat ini, set ikan bakar dan set ayam goreng tepung sangat populer!

14
00:00:48,698 --> 00:00:53,365
Ikan bakarnya ikan apa?

15
00:00:53,388 --> 00:00:58,491
Hari ini salmon panggang asin.

16
00:00:58,514 --> 00:01:01,548
Sangat enak.

17
00:01:01,571 --> 00:01:06,037
Salmon? Bagus deh.

18
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:10,497
Set ayam goreng tepung itu seperti apa?

19
00:01:10,521 --> 00:01:15,703
Terdiri dari 5 potong ayam goreng tepung.

20
00:01:15,726 --> 00:01:20,993
Dilengkapi dengan salad, nasi, dan sup miso.

21
00:01:21,016 --> 00:01:24,449
Banyak juga ya.

22
00:01:24,472 --> 00:01:29,857
Saya suka daging, jadi saya pesan set ayam goreng tepung.

23
00:01:29,881 --> 00:01:32,947
Terima kasih.

24
00:01:32,970 --> 00:01:37,313
Untuk nasi, ukurannya bagaimana?

25
00:01:37,336 --> 00:01:41,473
Ada ukuran apa saja?

26
00:01:41,497 --> 00:01:47,397
Ada kecil, sedang, dan jumbo.

27
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:50,887
Jumbo-nya gratis lho.

28
00:01:50,910 --> 00:01:54,468
Gratis?

29
00:01:54,492 --> 00:01:59,458
Tapi, saya pesan yang ukuran sedang saja.

30
00:01:59,481 --> 00:02:02,591
Baiklah.

31
00:02:02,615 --> 00:02:05,715
Jadi, ukuran sedang ya.

32
00:02:05,738 --> 00:02:10,638
Di sup miso-nya ada apa saja?

33
00:02:10,661 --> 00:02:15,361
Ada tahu dan rumput laut.

34
00:02:15,384 --> 00:02:19,537
Tidak pedas kan?

35
00:02:19,561 --> 00:02:24,478
Iya, tidak pedas.

36
00:02:24,501 --> 00:02:27,659
Tenang saja.

37
00:02:27,682 --> 00:02:30,635
Syukurlah.

38
00:02:30,658 --> 00:02:34,726
Minuman apa yang ada?

39
00:02:34,750 --> 00:02:40,138
Ada air putih dingin dan teh hangat.

40
00:02:40,161 --> 00:02:44,670
Kalau begitu, saya pesan teh hangat.

41
00:02:44,693 --> 00:02:48,006
Siap.

42
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:50,747
Jadi, teh hangat ya.

43
00:02:50,770 --> 00:02:55,239
Makanan kira-kira berapa menit sampai siap?

44
00:02:55,263 --> 00:02:59,251
Kira-kira 10 menit.

45
00:02:59,274 --> 00:03:01,908
Baiklah.

46
00:03:01,931 --> 00:03:05,797
Saya tunggu sambil senang-senang.

47
00:03:05,820 --> 00:03:10,495
Baiklah, saya konfirmasi pesanan Anda.

48
00:03:10,519 --> 00:03:15,104
Jadi, set ayam goreng tepung ukuran sedang dan teh hangat ya.

49
00:03:15,128 --> 00:03:18,923
Iya, benar.

50
00:03:18,946 --> 00:03:21,902
Terima kasih.

51
00:03:21,926 --> 00:03:24,916
Terima kasih.

52
00:03:24,939 --> 00:03:28,707
Mohon ditunggu sebentar.

53
00:03:28,730 --> 00:03:30,230
Babak 2: Mengenal Restoran Sushi Putar / Introduction to Conveyor Belt Sushi

54
00:03:30,230 --> 00:03:37,064
Takeshi, ini pertama kalinya saya makan di restoran sushi berputar.

55
00:03:37,087 --> 00:03:40,023
Beneran?!

56
00:03:40,046 --> 00:03:45,912
Di sini banyak sushi lezat yang berputar-putar lho!

57
00:03:45,935 --> 00:03:52,202
Piringnya bergerak-gerak, seru banget ya!

58
00:03:52,225 --> 00:03:57,603
Mau saya buatkan teh hangat dulu?

59
00:03:57,626 --> 00:04:01,926
Bagaimana cara membuatnya?

60
00:04:01,949 --> 00:04:10,016
Masukkan bubuk teh hijau ini ke dalam gelas, lalu tekan tombol air panas di sana.

61
00:04:10,039 --> 00:04:13,178
Baiklah.

62
00:04:13,202 --> 00:04:18,778
Airnya panas, jadi hati-hati ya.

63
00:04:18,801 --> 00:04:24,906
Iya. Boleh kan saya ambil piring yang berputar?

64
00:04:24,929 --> 00:04:29,231
Bisa juga pesan lewat panel sentuh lho.

65
00:04:29,255 --> 00:04:34,793
Jadi bisa pesan lewat panel sentuh juga, ya?

66
00:04:34,816 --> 00:04:37,892
Praktis banget!

67
00:04:37,915 --> 00:04:42,581
An, kamu suka ikan yang mana?

68
00:04:42,604 --> 00:04:48,071
Saya suka salmon dan tuna.

69
00:04:48,094 --> 00:04:53,627
Kalau begitu, pesan salmon dan tuna saja yuk.

70
00:04:53,650 --> 00:04:57,884
Ada wasabi-nya?

71
00:04:57,907 --> 00:05:02,540
Saya nggak tahan pedas.

72
00:05:02,563 --> 00:05:08,667
Di panel sentuh, bisa pilih tanpa wasabi lho.

73
00:05:08,690 --> 00:05:12,357
Syukurlah!

74
00:05:12,380 --> 00:05:16,513
Permisi, salmon tanpa wasabi ya.

75
00:05:16,536 --> 00:05:21,003
Iya, sudah saya tekan tombolnya.

76
00:05:21,026 --> 00:05:27,359
Piringnya beda warna, harganya juga beda?

77
00:05:27,382 --> 00:05:35,057
Iya. Piring putih harganya 100 yen, piring merah 200 yen.

78
00:05:35,081 --> 00:05:38,947
Jelas banget ya.

79
00:05:38,970 --> 00:05:45,404
Oh, sushi salmon yang tadi dipesan sudah datang naik kereta peluru!

80
00:05:45,426 --> 00:05:50,304
Wah, kereta peluru-nya berhenti!

81
00:05:50,328 --> 00:05:53,561
Lucu banget!

82
00:05:53,584 --> 00:05:59,251
Ambil piringnya, lalu tekan tombol atas ya.

83
00:05:59,274 --> 00:06:02,941
Iya, sudah saya ambil.

84
00:06:02,964 --> 00:06:06,664
Cantikk!

85
00:06:06,687 --> 00:06:10,987
Celupkan ke saus kecap ya.

86
00:06:11,010 --> 00:06:13,676
Mantap!

87
00:06:13,699 --> 00:06:18,878
Ikan ini empuk dan enak banget.

88
00:06:18,902 --> 00:06:22,637
Makan banyak-banyak ya.

89
00:06:22,661 --> 00:06:28,927
Ada juga sushi, es krim, dan kue lho.

90
00:06:28,950 --> 00:06:32,709
Jadi ada hidangan penutup juga!

91
00:06:32,733 --> 00:06:37,006
Nanti mau makan es krim.

92
00:06:37,029 --> 00:06:39,963
Bagus deh.

93
00:06:39,986 --> 00:06:47,019
Kalau sudah makan banyak, terakhir hitung piringnya untuk bayar.

94
00:06:47,042 --> 00:06:50,175
Baiklah.

95
00:06:50,198 --> 00:06:55,231
Makan sushi enak banyak-banyak yuk!

96
00:06:55,254 --> 00:06:59,253
Iya, mari makan sambil senang-senang!

97
00:06:59,277 --> 00:07:00,777
Adegan 3: Memesan di Warung Ramen

98
00:07:00,777 --> 00:07:03,947
Permisi.

99
00:07:03,971 --> 00:07:06,804
Selamat datang!

100
00:07:06,827 --> 00:07:10,937
Silakan duduk di kursi bar.

101
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:13,902
Terima kasih.

102
00:07:13,926 --> 00:07:17,559
Saya sudah beli tiket makanan.

103
00:07:17,582 --> 00:07:20,349
Permisi.

104
00:07:20,372 --> 00:07:25,705
Iya, tiket makanannya saya terima.

105
00:07:25,728 --> 00:07:31,165
Pesanan: ramen kecap dan set pangsit.

106
00:07:31,189 --> 00:07:33,977
Terima kasih.

107
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:37,878
Untuk mie-nya mau yang gimana?

108
00:07:37,902 --> 00:07:41,736
Ada jenis mie apa saja?

109
00:07:41,759 --> 00:07:48,792
Ada mie keras, mie biasa, dan mie lembut.

110
00:07:48,815 --> 00:07:54,315
Karena ini pertama kalinya, saya pesan mie biasa ya.

111
00:07:54,338 --> 00:07:57,638
Baiklah.

112
00:07:57,661 --> 00:08:00,728
Mie biasa ya.

113
00:08:00,751 --> 00:08:05,784
Apakah rasanya sup juga bisa diubah?

114
00:08:05,807 --> 00:08:08,341
Bisa.

115
00:08:08,364 --> 00:08:15,242
Ada rasa kental, biasa, dan ringan.

116
00:08:15,265 --> 00:08:20,044
Saya pesan sup yang ringan.

117
00:08:20,067 --> 00:08:23,367
Baiklah.

118
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:27,290
Supnya ringan ya.

119
00:08:27,314 --> 00:08:32,661
Saya juga mau telur dimasukkan ke dalam ramen.

120
00:08:32,684 --> 00:08:35,475
Berapa harganya?

121
00:08:35,499 --> 00:08:40,732
Telurnya 100 rupiah per butir.

122
00:08:40,755 --> 00:08:43,989
Sangat enak.

123
00:08:44,012 --> 00:08:48,881
Kalau begitu, saya pesan satu telur.

124
00:08:48,904 --> 00:08:54,638
Baik, terima kasih 100 rupiahnya.

125
00:08:54,661 --> 00:08:58,894
Ada apa di atas meja?

126
00:08:58,917 --> 00:09:02,866
Itu saus pangsit.

127
00:09:02,890 --> 00:09:08,327
Ada kecap, cuka, dan minyak cabai.

128
00:09:08,350 --> 00:09:12,050
Minyak cabainya pedas?

129
00:09:12,074 --> 00:09:19,457
Iya, agak pedas, jadi pakai sedikit saja ya.

130
00:09:19,481 --> 00:09:22,458
Baiklah.

131
00:09:22,481 --> 00:09:26,782
Airnya di mana?

132
00:09:26,806 --> 00:09:33,586
Airnya ada di teko di depan, silakan tuang ke gelas.

133
00:09:33,610 --> 00:09:36,976
Saya tuang sendiri ya.

134
00:09:36,999 --> 00:09:39,918
Terima kasih.

135
00:09:39,942 --> 00:09:43,495
Maaf sudah menunggu!

136
00:09:43,519 --> 00:09:48,786
Ramen kecap dengan telur dan pangsit.

137
00:09:48,809 --> 00:09:53,711
Wah, baunya enak banget!

138
00:09:53,734 --> 00:09:59,282
Panas, jadi hati-hati makannya ya.

139
00:09:59,305 --> 00:10:02,239
Mantap!

140
00:10:02,262 --> 00:10:07,632
Sup dan mie-nya sangat enak.

141
00:10:07,655 --> 00:10:10,355
Terima kasih.

142
00:10:10,378 --> 00:10:13,945
Silakan dinikmati!

143
00:10:13,968 --> 00:10:15,468
Adegan 4: Percakapan Pemesanan di Kafe

144
00:10:15,468 --> 00:10:18,135
Halo.

145
00:10:18,158 --> 00:10:21,108
Selamat datang.

146
00:10:21,131 --> 00:10:24,964
Silakan pesan.

147
00:10:24,987 --> 00:10:30,864
Saya mau kopi panas dan makan kue.

148
00:10:30,888 --> 00:10:33,826
Terima kasih.

149
00:10:33,850 --> 00:10:37,916
Kue apa yang ingin Anda coba?

150
00:10:37,939 --> 00:10:42,090
Ada kue apa saja?

151
00:10:42,114 --> 00:10:49,814
Ada cheesecake, chocolate cake, dan tart matcha.

152
00:10:49,837 --> 00:10:54,109
Cheesecake-nya manis?

153
00:10:54,132 --> 00:11:00,038
Tidak terlalu manis, rasanya enak banget.

154
00:11:00,061 --> 00:11:04,636
Kalau begitu, saya pesan cheesecake.

155
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:08,494
Siap.

156
00:11:08,517 --> 00:11:13,750
Saya akan pesan set kopi dan kue.

157
00:11:13,773 --> 00:11:17,506
Set-nya jadi lebih murah?

158
00:11:17,529 --> 00:11:20,162
Iya.

159
00:11:20,185 --> 00:11:25,689
Set-nya jadi 50 rupiah lebih murah.

160
00:11:25,713 --> 00:11:28,546
Senang sekali!

161
00:11:28,569 --> 00:11:31,803
Saya pesan set.

162
00:11:31,826 --> 00:11:36,292
Untuk ukuran kopinya bagaimana?

163
00:11:36,315 --> 00:11:40,189
Ada ukuran apa saja?

164
00:11:40,213 --> 00:11:46,579
Ada ukuran S, M, dan L.

165
00:11:46,602 --> 00:11:51,569
Kalau begitu, saya pesan ukuran M.

166
00:11:51,592 --> 00:11:55,944
Pakai susu dan gula?

167
00:11:55,968 --> 00:12:02,559
Tidak pakai susu, tapi gula satu ya.

168
00:12:02,583 --> 00:12:05,486
Baiklah.

169
00:12:05,509 --> 00:12:09,251
Gula satu ya.

170
00:12:09,274 --> 00:12:12,974
Makan di tempat.

171
00:12:12,997 --> 00:12:16,331
Ada kursi kosong?

172
00:12:16,353 --> 00:12:19,087
Iya.

173
00:12:19,110 --> 00:12:23,943
Ada kursi di dekat jendela bagian belakang yang kosong.

174
00:12:23,966 --> 00:12:27,806
Saya pesan kursi di dekat jendela.

175
00:12:27,829 --> 00:12:30,896
Terima kasih.

176
00:12:30,919 --> 00:12:36,152
Totalnya 750 yen ya.

177
00:12:36,175 --> 00:12:41,009
Bisa bayar pakai kartu kredit?

178
00:12:41,032 --> 00:12:43,698
Iya.

179
00:12:43,721 --> 00:12:48,655
Tolong tempel kartunya di mesin ini.

180
00:12:48,678 --> 00:12:51,744
Sudah ditap.

181
00:12:51,767 --> 00:12:54,509
Terima kasih.

182
00:12:54,533 --> 00:12:59,692
Tolong ambil nomor antrian ini dan tunggu di kursi ya.

183
00:12:59,715 --> 00:13:03,388
Iya, baiklah.

184
00:13:03,412 --> 00:13:06,078
Terima kasih.

185
00:13:06,101 --> 00:13:11,235
Kue dan kopi akan saya antar ke kursi Anda.

186
00:13:11,258 --> 00:13:12,758
Scene 5: Bersulang di Izakaya / Cheers at an Izakaya

187
00:13:12,758 --> 00:13:18,191
Terima kasih atas kerja keras hari ini, Pak Tanaka.

188
00:13:18,214 --> 00:13:22,588
Terima kasih, Bu Yumi.

189
00:13:22,612 --> 00:13:26,519
Mari masuk ke izakaya.

190
00:13:26,542 --> 00:13:29,084
Iya.

191
00:13:29,108 --> 00:13:34,176
Tempat ini ramai tapi enak ya.

192
00:13:34,199 --> 00:13:39,899
Yuk pesan minuman dulu.

193
00:13:39,922 --> 00:13:42,477
Bagus deh.

194
00:13:42,501 --> 00:13:46,976
Pak Tanaka mau minum apa?

195
00:13:46,999 --> 00:13:52,109
Saya mau bir dingin.

196
00:13:52,133 --> 00:13:55,833
Bu Yumi mau minum apa?

197
00:13:55,856 --> 00:14:02,956
Saya tidak terlalu kuat minum alkohol, jadi saya pesan teh oolong saja.

198
00:14:02,978 --> 00:14:06,445
Baiklah.

199
00:14:06,468 --> 00:14:13,801
Permisi, satu bir dan satu teh oolong ya.

200
00:14:13,824 --> 00:14:18,607
Minumannya cepat datang juga ya.

201
00:14:18,630 --> 00:14:22,297
Yuk, bersulang!

202
00:14:22,321 --> 00:14:25,717
Terima kasih atas kerja kerasnya.

203
00:14:25,740 --> 00:14:28,528
Cheers!

204
00:14:28,551 --> 00:14:32,656
Dingin dan enak banget.

205
00:14:32,679 --> 00:14:37,228
Mau pesan makanan apa?

206
00:14:37,252 --> 00:14:42,886
Saya mau pesan yakitori dan edamame.

207
00:14:42,909 --> 00:14:45,847
Bagus deh.

208
00:14:45,870 --> 00:14:53,039
Yakitori ada yang rasa garam dan saus, mau yang mana?

209
00:14:53,063 --> 00:14:58,454
Saya lebih suka yang garam.

210
00:14:58,477 --> 00:15:02,744
Kalau begitu, pesan yakitori rasa garam ya.

211
00:15:02,767 --> 00:15:07,085
Ada juga set sashimi lho.

212
00:15:07,108 --> 00:15:10,775
Sashimi juga enak.

213
00:15:10,798 --> 00:15:14,716
Yuk pesan bareng.

214
00:15:14,739 --> 00:15:18,373
Iya, mari pesan.

215
00:15:18,396 --> 00:15:24,229
Bu Yumi ada makanan yang tidak boleh dimakan?

216
00:15:24,252 --> 00:15:30,886
Saya tidak boleh makan udang.

217
00:15:30,910 --> 00:15:34,043
Baiklah.

218
00:15:34,066 --> 00:15:38,341
Saya akan pilih menu yang tidak ada udang.

219
00:15:38,364 --> 00:15:41,400
Terima kasih.

220
00:15:41,423 --> 00:15:46,018
Mau makan salad sayur juga?

221
00:15:46,041 --> 00:15:49,223
Bagus deh.

222
00:15:49,247 --> 00:15:54,006
Salad tomat dan tahu saja yuk.

223
00:15:54,030 --> 00:15:57,068
Bagus banget.

224
00:15:57,091 --> 00:16:00,125
Saya pesan itu.

225
00:16:00,148 --> 00:16:04,814
Permisi, mau pesan.

226
00:16:04,837 --> 00:16:10,178
Terima kasih sudah memesannya, Pak Tanaka.

227
00:16:10,202 --> 00:16:16,389
Sama-sama, mari makan banyak dan ngobrol banyak.

228
00:16:16,413 --> 00:16:21,748
Iya, mari makan banyak makanan enak.

229
00:16:21,771 --> 00:16:27,087
Sambil menunggu makanan, mari makan edamame dulu.

230
00:16:27,110 --> 00:16:28,610
Scene 6: Cara Memilih Pasta dan Pizza / How to Choose Pasta and Pizza

231
00:16:28,610 --> 00:16:35,982
Kenji, restoran Italia ini cantik banget ya.

232
00:16:36,006 --> 00:16:40,039
Iya, Mbak Emi.

233
00:16:40,062 --> 00:16:46,429
Tempat ini terkenal banget sama pasta dan pizzanya.

234
00:16:46,452 --> 00:16:51,285
Menunya banyak banget ya.

235
00:16:51,308 --> 00:16:54,742
Mau makan apa?

236
00:16:54,765 --> 00:17:02,065
Kita pesan satu pasta dan satu pizza, lalu dibagi berdua aja, gimana?

237
00:17:02,088 --> 00:17:05,468
Ide bagus!

238
00:17:05,491 --> 00:17:12,191
Jadi kita bisa makan pasta dan pizza sekaligus.

239
00:17:12,214 --> 00:17:16,314
Pasta-nya mau yang mana?

240
00:17:16,337 --> 00:17:23,606
Ada pasta saus tomat dan pasta krim.

241
00:17:23,630 --> 00:17:28,663
Aku suka pasta saus tomat.

242
00:17:28,686 --> 00:17:35,236
Kalau gitu, kita pesan pasta tomat dan bacon ya.

243
00:17:35,259 --> 00:17:39,326
Pizza-nya mau yang mana?

244
00:17:39,349 --> 00:17:44,649
Aku pengin makan pizza keju sama tomat.

245
00:17:44,672 --> 00:17:48,805
Pizza Margherita ya.

246
00:17:48,828 --> 00:17:53,262
Pizzanya sangat populer lho.

